---
// Simple CTA for blog post endings
---

<section
  class="bg-[#003087] text-white py-16 px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-16 mt-12 rounded-xl shadow-xl max-w-5xl mx-auto"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold mb-4 leading-snug">
      Ready to stop overpaying for your MRI?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-blue-100 mb-8">
      Find transparent, upfront pricing from trusted imaging centers near you —
      with no surprise bills and no insurance required.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/search"
      class="inline-block bg-white text-[#003087] font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100 transition"
    >
      Find Affordable MRI Centers
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
